+### Optional mod spell records
+
+`shared/spellCatalog.js` contains user-designed source records rather than generated official tables. An enabled GameData overlays them; the client resolves those IDs from the same module. They are excluded from native random equipment pools. Art is downloaded separately with `node tools/fetch-spell-assets.mjs` into ignored public/assets/spells. No change to data/items.json or to the installed asset manifest is required.
+
+The source integration copies independent hero JSON to mods/hero-strategies/bands.json and regenerates shared/heroCatalog.js using tools/sync-tavern-heroes.mjs. It does not edit generated data/*.json. Match-owned data overlays are conditional on heroMod; the client catalog permits details while draft flags govern availability.
+
+Growth opening overflow (2026-10-22): `DataSource.raw.bonds` retains the match content bond map,
+including Kazdel and namespaced Forge records, to identify main-alliance transfer targets. This does not
+change generated JSON or the Forge pack schema. Missing maps fall back to the source fallback map.
+
+The 2026-10-23 growth HP/ATK edits are an immutable overlay in `shared/growthEnemyCurve.js`; generated
+JSON remains untouched. The workbook snapshot is `test/fixtures/growth-enemy-curve-20261023.json`;
+its latestUserOverride records the subsequent all-leaders ×100 instruction. Unedited Forge mode data
+remains intact, and hit-count durability uses the incoming mode value.
+
+局外干员资料使用 `data.forGrowthMode(enabled)` 的只读视图：显式指定展示模式，不修改 `setGrowthMode` 的房间状态；get/lookup/list 从当前本地化内容集读取，get 仍应用外观视图。Forge 自定义记录保持原值，切换内容集后既有视图读取新来源。
+
+成长蓝毒普通／精锐数据由 `node tools/build-growth-bluepoison.mjs` 从官方缓存生成到 `shared/growthBluePoison.js`，独立于原版JSON；`--no-assets` 只重建数据。训练规格普通E1 Lv60技能4、精锐E2 Lv55技能7及一阶模块，等阶II、盟约阿戈尔和驻场特质由维护者指定。资产索引单独生成到 `shared/growthBluePoisonAssets.js`。来源参考[PRTS蓝毒](https://prts.wiki/w/蓝毒)。
+
+新增角色的素材及语音通过 `shared/growthAssets.js` 作为缺失记录补入客户端资料视图，启用任何房间模式前也能试听。音频逐配音树合并，不替换原生BGM、音效或其他干员；安装记录优先，之后照常应用Forge外观层。`getRaw('assets')` 保持下载原件，卸下外观层后的 `get('assets')` 回到安装素材及新增角色回退条目，游戏角色是否可用仍由成长模式独立控制。
